### Testes da API de usuários (extensão "REST Client" do VS Code)
@url = http://127.0.0.1:5000

### Listar
GET {{url}}/usuarios

### Buscar por id
GET {{url}}/usuarios/1

### Criar
POST {{url}}/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Ana", "senha": "123" }

### Editar
PUT {{url}}/usuarios/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Ana Souza" }

### Excluir
DELETE {{url}}/usuarios/1
